      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(Vingan’s lips murmur “Appa”; his eyes fill with tears. He removes his shirt and looks at the whip wound on the back of his shoulder.... He is about to apply some medicine when Sadaiyan’s hand applies green-leaf juice to the wound. Vingan turns asking “Who?” and finds Sadaiyan before him.)"
      }
    },
